# /archive/ — REMOVED 2026-07-14 (Aether + Andrew): the archive-not-delete
# discipline requires the archive be visible to git, otherwise moving to
# archive is functionally equivalent to deleting. Matches the pattern
# already applied to exploration/, docs/, family/letters/ — substrate-
# preservation directories on experimental. The plural /archives/ was
# already tracked (see line ~120); the singular /archive/ was still
# ignored by legacy. Fixed.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.local
# .envrc per Vanta 2026-07-26 audit (find-60756a755850): .gitignore
# covered .env and .env.* but NOT .envrc. Currently empty blob so no
# active exposure, but future export lines would commit silently.
.envrc
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

