*.tmp
tmp/
clone_*/
# Windows bash runtime crash artifacts — read once (msys-2.0.dll runtime
# crashes; not DivineOS-code-level). Aletheia F91 2026-07-26: crash dump
# that keeps updating means bash is still crashing — signal for
# investigation, not for version control.
*.stackdump

