# Generated graphify output — 12MB graph.json, regenerated by /graphify.
# Kept on disk, out of git: it is a build artifact, not source, and it was
# never meant to ride along in a gate PR. 2026-08-01.
src/graphify-out/
# Dated per-member graph exports (graphify-out-<name>-<date>/). The bare
# rule below misses these because the directory name differs. Aether's
# 2026-08-14 export reached a branch this way and carried 1.3M lines with
# it. Preserved outside the repo at ~/.divineos-shared/graphify/.
#
# The date is IN the pattern deliberately. The obvious `graphify-out-*/`
# also swallows graphify-out-code/, which is not an export — `divineos
# wiring dark` and a briefing surface read its .graphify_ast.json at that
# exact path, so untracking it breaks a live command on any fresh clone.
# Caught 2026-08-19 by the tracked-but-ignored scan reporting 1 remaining
# instead of 0, while writing this very rule.
graphify-out-*-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
graphify-out/
